<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Charles Taylor (Liberian politician)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1948">1948</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a> · Also known as Charles Ghankay Taylor, Charles Taylor, Charles McArthur Ghankay Taylor</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Charles Taylor is a Liberian warlord and politician who launched the rebellion of 1989 that began the First Liberian Civil War and was president of Liberia from 1997 to 2003. He backed the Revolutionary United Front in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sierra-leone">Sierra Leone</a>'s civil war, and in 2012 the Special Court for Sierra Leone convicted him of war crimes and crimes against humanity and sentenced him to 50 years in prison.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/charles-taylor-liberia.jpg" alt="Charles Taylor (Liberian politician)" width="320" height="400" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Plymouth County Sheriff's Office · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Charles_Taylor_1984_mugshot_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>In December 1989 <b>Charles Taylor</b>’s National Patriotic Front of Liberia invaded from Côte d’Ivoire, starting a civil war in which factions fought largely along ethnic lines and used child soldiers.</blockquote><a href="/empire/liberia">Liberia · Military</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Arthington, in what is now <a href="/countries/liberia">Liberia</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=6.52,-10.68&amp;year=1983" aria-label="Arthington on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4254 1920 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Charles Taylor (Liberian politician)"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M4704 2190h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M4704 2190h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=6.52,-10.68&amp;year=1983">What was here in 1983? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
